    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "34. CHECK OPERATION OF PARKING LOCK PAWL"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Make sure the planetary gear output shaft is locked when the manual valve lever is in \"P\" range."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 2,
      "description": "Illustration showing throttle cable installation through transmission case",
      "labels": [],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 22,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 37,
        "height": 18
      },
      "reference": "C4494"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "35. INSTALL NEW O-RING ON THROTTLE CABLE FITTING"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "36. INSTALL THROTTLE CABLE IN CASE"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Push the cable through the case, being careful not to damage the O-ring. Check for full seating."
    },
    {
      "type": "caution",
      "text": "In subsequent work, be careful not to roll the case over the cable and break the cable fitting."
    },
