    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "38. PLACE VALVE BODY ON TRANSMISSION"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Make sure the accumulator pistons are pressed fully into the bore. Align the manual valve with the pin on the manual shift lever, and lower valve body into place."
    },
    {
      "type": "diagram",
      "index": 5,
      "description": "Illustration showing lifting side of valve body and attaching throttle cable with B2 and C2 pistons labeled",
      "labels": [
        "B2",
        "C2"
      ],
      "bbox": {
        "top": 76,
        "left": 3,
        "width": 37,
        "height": 18
      },
      "reference": "AT0901"
    },
    {
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "text": "39. LIFT SIDE OF VALVE BODY AND ATTACH THROTTLE CABLE"
    },
    {
      "type": "list",
      "ordered": false,
      "items": [
        "(a) While holding the cam down with your fingers, slip the cable end into the slot.",
        "(b) Make sure that the B2 and C2 accumulator piston springs is installed onto the piston."
      ]
    }
  ]
